# Visual concept

Before changing menu/battle look, read `concepts/ART_DIRECTION.md`.

Must match:

- **Style:** graphite pencil on notebook paper — not cyan neon
- **Theme:** `core/theme/style.tres` — cream parchment buttons/panels, ink `#2A3340` text
- **Backgrounds:** `src/ui/backgrounds/` — shared `BackgroundBase` + per-variant folders (`notebook` sketches, `classic_sky`, `notebook_sky`); battle `BackgroundHost` picks random from `variants[]`; menu / pack / level-select use `paper_page/` (`assets/background.png`); pack window adds doodles via `levels_pack/`
- **Menu layout:** Jet Math–style (`menu_notebook_modern_v3.png`) — 2 bottom CTAs + right HUD circles + center mascot; no 5-button stack
- **Battle:** horizontal flight (plane left → right), 4 lanes, round balloons, paper HUD language

Frames: `concepts/menu_notebook_modern_v3.png`, `concepts/battle_notebook_modern_v1.png`, `concepts/post_battle_notebook_concept_v3.png`, `concepts/levels_pack_notebook_concept_v1.png`.  
Pencil pack: `concepts/notebook_pencil/` (full UI kit: `ui_pack/`).
